{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ochFGZn0rV1794303987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩隻新股首日掛牌，股價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>圖形處理器提供商登臨科技跌穿招股價，收報213元，較招股價231元，低近百分之8，每手25股計，帳面蝕450元。股份公開發售部分，超額認購1.1倍，一手中籤率百分之百，國際發售輕微超購，集資淨額逾13億元。</p><p></p><p>半導體封測服務提供商芯德半導體收報11.4元，較招股價8.88元，高約兩成八。每手500股，不計手續費賺1,260元。股份公開發售部分錄得超額認購8.8倍，一手中籤率八成，國際發售輕超購，集資淨額近9億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.116994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:37.342153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:01.192864+00:00","content_hash":"2575bfd078b0e9910bba7f5c387d7116a04aa780a9e398caf2644cffe71ecf80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.116994+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}